      "text": "73-year-old female presenting with excessive thirst and frequent urination for 6 months. Character: passing urine many times, also at night; radiation: n/a; aggravated by sweet food; relieved by nothing. Severity 8/10. Associated: tiredness. PMH: Type 2 diabetes for 11 years. Drugs: Metformin 500 mg. Allergy: no known allergies. Family: asthma. Personal: non-smoker, no alcohol. Triage: URGENT."
